 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE Launch Your Marketing Career D3 Internships: Launch Your Marketing Career Are you a college student eager to gain real-world marketing experience? At D3, we offer hands-on internship opportunities designed to help you develop the skills you need to succeed in today’s fast-paced digital marketing world. Our Internship Program allows students to: 1. Work alongside digital marketing experts to gain insights into strategy, content creation, website management, analytics, social media, and more! 2. Participate in real-world client projects, from planning and execution to reporting. Our Internship Program gives you tangible work experience to strengthen your resume. 3. Gain hands-on experience in your chosen field and develop expertise in digital marketing, setting yourself apart in a competitive job market. Apply today and take your first step toward a career in marketing! First Name Last Name Email Address Phone Number College/University Name Current Year (Junior, Senior, etc.) Major/Field of Study Expected Graduation Date Preferred Start Date LinkedIn Profile Why are you interested in a marketing internship at D3? Attach Resume | Supported formats: PDF, DOC, DOCX, JPG This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. SUBMIT The Intern Edit See what our previous interns have to say about their experience at D3! Kierstyn Lauren Brooke Darby Haley See More Intern Reviews! Frequently Asked Questions Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services 